s a library/utility rather than claiming to solve everything.\n\nI'll approve this. Promise score: It addresses the core technical mandate well but has gaps in specificity (purpose-specific events, log governance, retention). I'd say around 78-82. It's clearly the right direction and high-value for compliance, but not a complete Article 12 solution on its own.\n\nLet me settle on 80.\n",
